  "method": "Two run orders on the same Apple M4 Max, 40 GPU cores, 48 GiB unified memory. Each build loads the same native checkpoint, reserves 262144 tokens, then runs three fresh 8192-token text prefills and 32 decode steps each at batch 1024, FP16 KV, with kernel profiling off. Loading and warmup are excluded. GPU jobs run sequentially; results include run-to-run system variability. Production source is unchanged. The prototype patch was built only in an isolated checkout. Peak memory is Metal allocation, not whole-process RSS.",
